{"data":{"id":17751,"name":"Threshold","symbol":"T","slug":"threshold","category":"token","description":"Threshold Network powers tBTC, a decentralized, trust-minimized representation of Bitcoin backed 1:1 by BTC. tBTC uses threshold cryptography and distributed signer groups to secure Bitcoin deposits without relying on a single centralized custodian. It enables Bitcoin holders to access decentralized finance applications across supported blockchains and redeem tBTC for native BTC.\n\nT is Threshold Network’s ERC-20 utility and governance token on Ethereum. T holders can vote on protocol and treasury proposals and stake T to receive fee waivers and rebates on tBTC minting and redemption. Threshold originated from the merger of NuCypher and Keep Network and subsequently focused its development on tBTC and Bitcoin infrastructure.","dateAdded":"2022-01-31T08:26:28.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2022-02-10T16:35:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":1,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:45:00.000Z","watchCount":"38181","watchListRanking":803,"dateLaunched":"2021-12-29T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":0.1743,"tags":[{"slug":"ethereum-ecosystem","name":"Ethereum Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"bitcoin-ecosystem","name":"Bitcoin Ecosystem","category":"PLATFORM","status":1,"priority":2},{"slug":"binance-ecosystem","name":"Binance Ecosystem","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"binance-listing","name":"Binance Listing","category":"CATEGORY","status":0,"priority":5}],"selfReportedTags":["DeFi","Ethereum Ecosystem","Cross-Chain","Bitcoin Ecosystem","BTCfi"],"selfReportedCirculatingSupply":"11155000000.00","urls":{"website":["https://threshold.network/"],"technical_doc":["https://docs.threshold.network/"],"explorer":["https://etherscan.io/token/0xCdF7028ceAB81fA0C6971208e83fa7872994beE5","https://etherscan.io/address/0xCdF7028ceAB81fA0C6971208e83fa7872994beE5